<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African July trade figures due from Wednesday.</title>
<headline>S.African July trade figures due from Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African July trade figures will be released from Wednesday, an official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The data had originally been Scheduled for release last week, but was postponed until this week. The release time will be 0800 GMT.</p>
<p>Analysts polled by Reuters have forecast a 600 million rand surplus for the month, after a deficit of 27.6 million rand in June.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
